      "promptEs": "ser + participio",
      "questionEn": "How do you say that an action is done to someone or something?",
      "answerEn": "Use a form of ser, then the verb's completed-action form.",
      "noteEn": "Spanish calls that completed-action form a past participle, often ending in -ado or -ido. In this passive pattern it changes to match the person or thing: atrapado for one masculine person, atrapada for one feminine person, and plural forms ending in -ados or -adas.",
